---

---

<section id="agent-native" class="section">
  <div class="agent-header reveal">
    <h2 class="heading-lg">built for ai agents, not just humans.</h2>
    <p class="subhead agent-sub">
      your meeting notes live on your filesystem as plain markdown — not in someone else's cloud.
      any ai agent with file access can read, search, and act on them.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="agent-split">
    <div class="agent-conversation reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <div class="agent-terminal">
        <div class="terminal-chrome">
          <span class="terminal-dot"></span>
          <span class="terminal-dot"></span>
          <span class="terminal-dot"></span>
          <span class="terminal-title">claude code</span>
        </div>
        <div class="agent-chat preserve-case">
          <div class="chat-msg chat-human">
            <span class="chat-role">You</span>
            <p>What did we decide about the API migration timeline in today's standup?</p>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-msg chat-agent">
            <span class="chat-role">Claude</span>
            <p>Reading <strong>2026-02-10_standup-sync.md</strong> — found the "API v3 Migration" topic...</p>
            <p>Marcus reported the migration is <strong>90% complete</strong> — auth endpoints are fully migrated, billing webhooks are the remaining work. <strong>Friday deploy target</strong>.</p>
            <p>Two open action items: Kyle has endpoint tests by Thursday, Sarah has SDK tests.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-msg chat-human">
            <span class="chat-role">You</span>
            <p>Draft a follow-up email to the team with those deadlines.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-msg chat-agent">
            <span class="chat-role">Claude</span>
            <p>Done. I've drafted the email in your ~/drafts folder with the migration deadlines and action items from the standup.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="agent-explain reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <div class="agent-point">
        <span class="glyph glyph-saved">✓</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="heading-md">files, not apis</h3>
          <p>notes save to ~/Documents as markdown. no proprietary format, no cloud sync, no account required. you own every byte.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="agent-point">
        <span class="glyph glyph-processing">◎</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="heading-md">any agent reads them</h3>
          <p>claude code, cowork, chatgpt, gemini — if it can read files, it can use your meeting notes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="agent-point">
        <span class="glyph glyph-idle">●</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="heading-md">structured for machines</h3>
          <p>yaml frontmatter with topics, speakers, tags. action items with owners. grep-friendly, llm-ready.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .agent-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .agent-sub {
    margin: var(--space-lg) auto 0;
  }

  .agent-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* conversation */

  .agent-terminal {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .agent-chat {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .chat-msg {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .chat-role {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .chat-human .chat-role { color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .chat-agent .chat-role { color: var(--accent); }

  .chat-msg p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .chat-agent p {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .chat-msg strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* explanation */

  .agent-explain {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .agent-point {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .agent-point .glyph {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .agent-point p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .agent-split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
